Gentleman,

As noted separately Leemco is reacting to our announcement.  Please report =
any Leemco intelligence.

Attached find Brief on the 2012 DI Price Increase.

This document is intended to acquaint you with the details of the changes t=
hat were made as seen in the Quote Forms recently mounted on the web site a=
nd some of the background on why the changes were made.  Also discussed are=
 things that were not done.

Also attached are Excel sheets with Old List, New List, and Percentage Chan=
ge for each line item.

Looking forward:


=B7         New PDF Price Sheets will be mounted next week=85=85=85get your=
 inputs into Shelley


=B7         New Quote Forms updated consistent with PDF Price sheets will b=
e mounted shortly thereafter


=B7         In both cases the new additions, deletions, and changes of form=
at will be incorporated.


=B7         It will take about 3 weeks to have new price sheets printed put=
ting their general availability at mid-February.  We will have price sheets=
 for Golf Show.


=B7         Categories and Thread Fitting discounts will be implemented the=
 week before 2/6/12



=B7         New pricing will be implemented on the network the weekend befo=
re 2/6/12

Call me if you have any questions.

John


